DeepSeek Harness original framework and UI sources. MIT license.
Source: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
Reference commit: 39163dd30f703a79079e2d2446545cff3c453738, obtained 2026-11-22.
Original source files and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in sources.json.
Client dependency archives are recorded in client-dependencies.json with exact versions and SHA-512 integrity. Their original licenses are included in licenses/.
Generated bundles use the original Cordis Loader, tool registry, SlotRegistry and React slot renderer. Tervell supplies local host services and semantic UI placements.
Original theme tokens are preserved with Tervell selector and semantic color bindings at build time.
